  "abstract_summary": "The detection of sea mines in side-scan sonar imagery is hindered by small object size, heavy speckle noise, and severe data scarcity. Existing studies mostly transplant improvements designed for natural images to sonar scenarios, and their effectiveness under small-sample conditions lacks unified verification. This...",
